  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s14-t01-knowledge-01-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "knowledge",
      "title": "常考面积、周长与体积",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看问的是周长、面积、表面积还是体积，单位必须分别对应长度、平方、立方。拼接图形的外轮廓不含内部接缝；挖孔、凹槽、粘接要把保留与消失的面逐一认清。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "C_{\\text{正方形}}=4a,\\quad S_{\\text{正方形}}=a^2;\\quad C_{\\text{长方形}}=2(a+b),\\quad S_{\\text{长方形}}=ab"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "S_{\\triangle}=\\frac12ah,\\quad S_{\\text{梯形}}=\\frac{a+b}{2}h,\\quad C_{\\text{圆}}=2\\pi r,\\quad S_{\\text{圆}}=\\pi r^2"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "L_{\\text{扇形弧}}=\\frac{\\theta}{360^\\circ}\\,2\\pi r,\\quad S_{\\text{扇形}}=\\frac{\\theta}{360^\\circ}\\,\\pi r^2"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们这里的θ用角度制。扇形的整个周长还要在弧长之外加两条半径；原知识表中的立体量分别按表面积、体积理解。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "S_{\\text{正方体}}=6a^2,\\quad V_{\\text{正方体}}=a^3;\\quad S_{\\text{长方体}}=2(ab+bc+ca),\\quad V_{\\text{长方体}}=abc"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "V_{\\text{柱}}=S_{\\text{底}}h,\\quad V_{\\text{锥}}=\\frac13S_{\\text{底}}h,\\quad V_{\\text{球}}=\\frac43\\pi r^3"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "S_{\\text{圆柱侧}}=2\\pi rh,\\quad S_{\\text{圆柱全}}=2\\pi r^2+2\\pi rh,\\quad S_{\\text{球}}=4\\pi r^2"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
